- G1 → G1.1, G1.2 [AND] [sequential execution]
  - G1.1 → G1.1.1, G1.1.2 [OR] [FALLBACK(G1.1.1, G1.1.2)]
    - G1.1.2 → G1.1.2.1 [AND] [sequential execution]
  - G1.2 → G1.2.1, G1.2.2, G1.2.3, G1.2.4 [AND] [sequential execution]
    - Dish retrieval alternative is an OR decomposition: FALLBACK(G1.2.1, G1.2.2, G1.2.3) followed sequentially by G1.2.4.

- Task assignments:
  - G1.1.1 → AT1, AT2 [AND]
  - G1.1.2 → AT3, AT4, AT5, AT6, AT7 [AND]
  - G1.2.1 → AT8, AT9 [AND]
