This goal model captures the mission’s requirements by decomposing the overall objective (complete room service) into two main branches—food delivery and dish retrieval—with further alternatives and query checks to handle uncertainties (e.g., tray retrieval availability) and cooperation requirements (e.g., dish retrieval methods and door opening).

